  "definition": "Permit Issuance",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-07-23",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 300) #9362, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12345, eff 8-14-17; ss by #13406, eff 7-23-22",
